    "body": "Enable some bugprone clang-tidy checks, which seem useful.\r\n\r\nApart from a test-only bug, they didn't find anything severe, but I think it still makes sense to enable them, so that it is easier to read the resulting code. Also, it is trivial to disable them, if they turn out annoying.",
